      players: '3 players (standard).',
      deck: '78-card Italian-suited tarot pack. The Nice source describes the older Piedmontese / Marseille-style structure while noting that local players had largely switched to French-suited tarot cards by the early twentieth century.',
      equipment: '78-card Italian-suited tarot pack. The Nice source describes the older Piedmontese / Marseille-style structure while noting that local players had largely switched to French-suited tarot cards by the early twentieth century.',
      dealing: 'Each player receives 25 cards. The remaining 3 cards (the Talon) go to the dealer.',
